# RamArts agent guidance

Before changing data layer, media handling, Firebase, or deploy targets, read and follow **`PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`** at the repo root.

Non-negotiables unless the user explicitly overrides:
- Media = external HTTPS URLs (`UrlMediaList`), not Firebase Storage uploads
- Public content requires `published: true`
- Prefer Spark-safe Firestore queries (no unnecessary composite indexes)
- Production = Vercel deploy from **`main`**; update `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` changelog when you fix a mistake or pivot
